  "details": "<p>The\u00a0<em>tribus\u00a0Collina </em>was one of the four, large, urban tribes of Rome (<em>Palatina</em>,\u00a0<em>Collina</em>,\u00a0<em>Esquilina</em>,\u00a0<em>Suburana</em>), which corresponded to the four urban regions that Servius Tullius created.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "An early urban tribe of the city of Rome, reportedly established by Servius Tullius.",
